  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AVVA Caf Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Groupe Aboubacar Vanessa Valentin, SARL (Groupe AVVA is a small Ivoirienne enterprise that roasts, grinds, and distributes coffee, primarily expresso, adding value to coffee produced by farmers in the country. Funding will be used to: 1) purchase equipment, including a roaster, grinding mills, packaging.machine, hulling machines; 2) increase AVVAs working capital for purchase of green coffee and packaging; 3) procure training and technical assistance in grant and financial management, HACCP and quality control, and coffee production techniques.</narrative>
  </description>
